# GitHub Linguist Configuration
# Prevents large static JS/JSON/Mock assets from skewing repository language statistics

# Ignore generated builds & dependencies
client/dist/** linguist-vendored
client/node_modules/** linguist-vendored
client/pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-vendored

# Ignore heavy JSON mock data from skewing towards JavaScript/JSON
client/src/data/** linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-detectable=false
*.md linguist-documentation

# Optional: If you want GitHub to count only Golang (e.g. 95%+ Go for pure backend showcase),
# uncomment the line below:
# client/** linguist-vendored
